Or until something nasty comes up, like system shock, or a yellow/black
light immediately exploding. The system shock is fatal and has a 1/25
chance with each zap, which together with the vast number of uselet monster
forms means that polymorphing a pet is quite a gamble as it is.

> Polymorphing yourself is an abuse that lasts until it wears off 
                              ^^^^^
Your inflationary use of the word abuse is disturbing. Polyself is
definitely one of the intended uses of spells, wands and potions of
polymorph.

> The easiest way to keep a low level character from doing the dragon 
> protection scheme 

The what?

>                   is to make all random polymorphs use the current 
